dsh-plugin-bridge README · Support policy：- an alpha.4 mixed-profile removal exposed pnpm 11.22.0's known late-worker shutdown mechanism. Natural DSH calls reproduced it twice; isolated upstream single-patch controls and unmodified 11.26.0 returned applied/exit 0. The historical operation is not a PASS, and its original PID's exact package/thread was not retrospectively recovered. Use the Host's actual pnpm 11.26.0 or later, avoid overlapping package operations, and save pending handoffs before stopping the Host;
- installing with the CLI (`dsh plugin --profile web add`) may need one WebUI restart; on DSH 0.1.6-alpha.2 a first install from the WebUI Plugins page (add the package name `dsh-plugin-bridge`) applies live, while upgrading an existing install there needs a restart;
